Another way would be fixing bug C343-320 on NAO:
| Reading scroll of mail break illiterate conduct.

Given that in-game mail doesn't really change gameplay, this
seems like a bug that can be fixed without changing gameplay
for illiterate conduct players. (As far as I can tell, NAO's
changes are limited to bugfixes and changes to the interface
which are not gameplay-changing.)

It seems quite simple to fix by simply adding another check to
src/read.c near line 114. For vanilla NetHack 3.4.3, the patch
below should work; it seems it can be applied to NAO's patched
NetHack version, too (with an offset of 65 lines). Anyway, the
change is only one line, so it's probably less work to add the
line manually.

